idas; y si las fatigan, en un día morirán todas las ovejas.", "words": [[0, 102535], [2, 102702], [5, 102842], [8, 103002], [14, 103777], [17, 103858], [23, 104138], [28, 104478], [32, 104638], [36, 104798], [42, 105038], [46, 105338], [55, 105978], [57, 106378], [61, 106478], [67, 106778], [74, 107258], [76, 107398], [82, 107778], [91, 108729], [93, 108815], [96, 108895], [100, 109035], [109, 109855], [112, 109955], [115, 110095], [119, 110335], [127, 110835], [133, 111035], [137, 111335]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 112405, "end": 122113, "text": "Pase ahora mi señor delante de su siervo, y yo me iré poco a poco al paso del ganado que va delante de mí, y al paso de los niños, hasta que llegue a mi señor a Seir.", "words": [[0, 112405], [5, 112674], [11, 112914], [14, 113074], [20, 113354], [28, 113834], [31, 113954], [34, 114074], [42, 114754], [44, 115054], [47, 115234], [50, 115374], [54, 115654], [59, 115854], [61, 116014], [66, 116234], [69, 116434], [74, 116674], [78, 116914], [85, 117314], [89, 117454], [92, 117574], [100, 117974], [103, 118134], [107, 118294], [109, 118754], [112, 118874], [117, 119094], [120, 119254], [124, 119374], [131, 120317], [137, 120523], [141, 120683], [148, 120983], [150, 121023], [153, 121176], [159, 121330], [161, 121483]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 122463, "end": 134392, "text": "Y Esaú dijo: Dejaré ahora contigo de la gente que viene conmigo. Y él dijo: ¿Para qué esto? halle yo gracia en los ojos de mi señor.", "words": [[0, 122463], [2, 122809], [7, 123198], [13, 123775], [20, 124178], [26, 124398], [34, 124898], [37, 125018], [40, 125118], [46, 125338], [50, 125538], [56, 125738], [65, 129135], [67, 129324], [70, 129484], [76, 130252], [82, 130436], [86, 130636], [92, 131530], [98, 131680], [101, 131840], [108, 132260], [111, 132340], [115, 132440], [120, 132700], [123, 132900], [126, 132980]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 134742, "end": 138530, "text": "Así se volvió Esaú aquel día por su camino a Seir.", "words": [[0, 134742], [4, 1